ain the needed information. \nThe URL \"https://www.nsi.bg/census2011/pdocs2/census2011final_en.pdf\" from the google_search results appears to be a relevant document from the 2011 Bulgarian census. \nUsing the url_text_extractor tool to extract text from this URL might provide the necessary data to calculate the difference in tertiary education completion by gender. \nThis plan is helpful because it allows us to access specific information from a relevant source, which could lead to finding the needed data to complete the task goal.\n</plan>\n\n<action>\ntool: url_text_extractor\nparameters: {\"url\": \"https://www.nsi.bg/census2011/pdocs2/census2011final_en.pdf\"}\n</action>",
