      "content": "<memory>\nLooking at the past observations and actions from our conversation history, the most relevant memory for this step is from Step 1, Step 2, and Step 3. \nIn Step 1, the observation was to find the difference in the number of men and women who have completed tertiary education according to the 2011 Bulgarian census. \nThe action taken was to use the wikipedia_knowledge_searcher tool with the query \"2011 Bulgarian census tertiary education completion by gender\". \nHowever, the search results did not provide the specific numbers of men and women who completed tertiary education, but rather general information about tertiary education and lists of countries by tertiary education attainment.\nIn Step 2, the observation was the result of the google_search tool with the query \"2011 Bulgarian census data on tertiary education completion by gender\". \nThe results included various links to documents and websites related to education and demographics in Bulgaria, but still did not provide the specific numbers needed to calculate the difference in tertiary education completion by gender.\nIn Step 3, the observation was the result of the url_text_extractor tool with the URL \"https://www.nsi.bg/census2011/pdocs2/census2011final_en.pdf\". \nThe extracted text appears to be a PDF document from the 2011 Bulgarian census, but it is not clear if it contains the necessary information to calculate the difference in tertiary education completion by gender.\n</memory>\n\n<reflection>\nReflecting on the last action and its outcome, it appears that the task goal was not completed. \nThe last action was not successful in finding the specific numbers of men and women who completed tertiary education according to the 2011 Bulgarian census. \nAlthough the search results and extracted text provided some general information about tertiary education and demographics in Bulgaria, they did not contain the necessary data to calculate the difference in the number of men and women who completed tertiary education. \nTo make progress toward the task goal, it would be helpful to try a different approach, such as using a different tool or searching for a different document that may contain the needed information.\n</reflection>\n\n<plan>\nPlanning the next step based on memory and reflection, it would be helpful to try using the python_code_generator tool to calculate the difference in the number of men and women who completed tertiary education according to the 2011 Bulgarian census. \nHowever, this approach requires the specific numbers of men and women who completed tertiary education, which are not available from the previous steps. \nTherefore, the next step should be to use the google_search tool to search for a document or website that contains the specific numbers of men and women who completed tertiary education in Bulgaria in 2011.\nThis plan is helpful because it allows us to search for a specific document or website that may contain the needed information, which could lead to finding the necessary data to complete the task goal.\n</plan>\n\n<action>\ntool: google_search\nparameters: {\"query\": \"2011 Bulgarian census tertiary education completion statistics by gender\", \"num_results\": \"10\"}\n</action>",
