011 Bulgarian census. \nThe action taken was to use the wikipedia_knowledge_searcher tool with the query \"2011 Bulgarian census tertiary education completion by gender\". \nHowever, the search results did not provide the specific numbers of men and women who completed tertiary education, but rather general information about tertiary education and lists of countries by tertiary education attainment.\n</memory>\n\n<reflection>\nReflecting on the last action and its outcome, it appears that the task goal was not completed. \nThe last action was not successful in finding the specific numbers of men and women who completed tertiary education according to the 2011 Bulgarian census. \nAlthough the search results provided some general information about tertiary education, they did not contain the necessary data to calculate the difference in the number of men and women who completed tertiary education. \nTo make progress toward the task goal, it would be helpful to try a different search query or use a different tool to find the necessary data.\n</reflection>\n\n<plan>\nPlanning the next step based on memory and reflection, it would be helpful to try a different search query using the google_search tool. \nA more specific query, such as \"2011 Bulgarian census data on tertiary education completion by gender\", might yield more relevant results. \nThis plan is helpful because it allows us to search a broader range of sources and potentially find the necessary data to calculate the difference in the number of men and women who completed tertiary education. \nWe expect this action to achieve more relevant search results that can be used to complete the task goal.\n</plan>\n\n<action>\ntool: google_search\nparameters: {\"query\": \"2011 Bulgarian census data on tertiary education completion by gender\", \"num_results\": \"10\"}\n</action>']\n[Observation 3: 'Tool 'url_text_extractor' executed.\nResult: {\n  \"url\": \"https://www.nsi.bg/census2011/pdocs2/census2011final_en.pdf